        <p>The monthly meeting of the Teem Couricil was held at the Town Hall on Tueeday eving, the Mayor t'esiding. There wero also pveent :—Aldormen 7, Bolton, T Hiechinsrin, J Faira(ozh, T Fl Sutton, &amp; Francomh ; Couocillors J Baird, Jnian Lee Bennett. F W Meeks, r iiurton, A Peacock, Ql„Davies, D S Duncan, J Rribertn, James Evacs, F 40berts, John Ev W Rogs, L Eiisn, J .Greening, J Smothurst, D Tinuion, R Heaton, J Wit- A Jolley, A J Jolley with Messr.F J L Whittle (Town Clerk), S Wil;on (Deputy Town Cl,rk), J FAr- kunst (Borough Treasurer), J De%a (Water Engiw-Jor), 8 Hull:lock (Gas Engineer), and J Sutcliffe (iislis:.ant (Surveyor). A vote of condole Ace with the family of the late Alder- Man Wright was pa3sed at the cemmeneemcnt of the Proeeedinge. Election of Deputy Mayor.</p>
