        <p>CONTINUAL CURES IN LANCASHIRE. —Every week fresh evidence is reported in the newspapers concerning the wonderful cures effected in Lancasnire by Dr. Wil- liams' pink pills for pale people. The e pills have cured paralysis, locomotor ataxy, rheumatism and sciatica ; also all diseases arising from impoveriAment of the blood, scrofula, rickets, chronic erysipelas, consump- tion of the bowels and lungs, aneeinia, pale and Renew complexion,general muticular weakness, loss of appetite, palpitations, pains in the back, nervous headache, and neuralgia, early decay, all farms of female weakness and hysteria. These pills are a tonic not a purentive. They are genuine only with the full name, Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People, end are cold by chemists, and by Dr. Williams' Medicine Company, 46, Holborn Viaduct, London, E.C.. at 23 9d a box, or Aix boxes for 13s Pink pills sold loose or from glass jars are not Dr. Wil- liams' piek pills ; accept them only in the pink closed wrapper as above described. On this page wil! be found details of a remarkable sure in Warrington.</p>
